{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>在分享螢幕截圖或照片時，經常需要隱藏敏感資訊或標註重點，卻又不想讓編輯流程變得複雜。Moza 是一款專為快速打碼與標註而設計的工具，支援馬賽克、模糊、螢光筆、箭頭與自動編號等多種功能，而且所有處理均在裝置內完成，確保隱私安全。目前這款 App 正在限時免費，原價 US$ 0.99，現在即可零成本下載。</p>\n\n<h2>實用標註功能</h2>\n<p>Moza 最吸引人的是「一劃打碼」功能，只需手指在畫面上滑過，即可將人臉、車牌或文字像素化；模糊效果則可自然柔化敏感細節，適合保護隱私。此外，箭頭與自動編號工具讓標註變得精準有序，無論是 Bug 回報截圖還是教學說明，都能清晰傳達重點。整個操作直覺流暢，無需任何學習成本。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1242x2688bb-87-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1242x2688bb-88-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1242x2688bb-89-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1242x2688bb-90-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1242x2688bb-91-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1242x2688bb-92-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Moza – 馬賽克、模糊、打碼</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-12T15:38:39.395606+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":351,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"unknown"}}